  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.4. Increased capacity of Member States to improve social dialogue and labour relations laws, processes and institutions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the revision of its regulatory framework by Law 4808/2021, the Mediation and Arbitration Service of Greece (OMED) strengthened the skills of mediators and arbitrators based on a needs assessment approved by the tripartite board of directors in February 2023. From November 2022 to May 2023, the ILO, in collaboration with the Turin Centre and with support from the European Commission, implemented a three-tier training programme for the mediators and arbitrators of OMED.</narrative>
   </description>
   <document-link format="TEXT/HTML" url="https://www.ilo.org/IRDashboard/">
